{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1778517587782,"sessionID":"ses_1e8183fceffenG367CcnNzvwcT","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"grep","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-bb419830ceca859a","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"pattern":"CL_0002465"},"output":"Found 70 matches\n/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/__issue_context__.json:\n  Line 2:   \"body\": \"**CL term**\\n[CL_0000999](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000999) — CD4-positive CD11b-positive dendritic cell\\n\\n**Suggested revision of class hierarchy**\\nChange the Equivalent To class from `conventional dendritic cell` to [CD11b-positive dendritic cell](http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465).\\n\\n**Rationale**  \\nCurrently, CD4-positive CD11b-positive dendritic cell (CL_0000999) has `conventional dendritic cell` as its Equivalent To class. We propose changing it to CD11b-positive dendritic cell. This change reflects a more natural hierarchical relationship, as CD11b-positive dendritic cell represents a parent concept encompassing CD4-positive CD11b-positive dendritic cell.\\n\\nA concrete example supporting this change is already present in the ontology: CD4-negative, CD8-alpha-negative, CD11b-positive dendritic cell (CL_0002454) uses CD11b-positive dendritic cell as its Equivalent To class. Applying the same principle here ensures consistency and aligns with existing ontology modeling practices.\\n\\nThank you for your consideration.\\n\",\n\n\n/home/runner/work/eval-ont-agent-cl/eval-ont-agent-cl/__pr_result__/src/ontology/cl-refactored.owl:\n  Line 7825: SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000999> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465>)\n\n  Line 12564: EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002454> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl#lacks_plasma_membrane_part> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_000001004>) ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/cl#lacks_plasma_membrane_part> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_000001084>)))\n\n  Line 12565: SubClassOf(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#is_inferred> \"true\"^^xsd:string) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002454> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465>)\n\n  Line 12655: Declaration(Class(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465>))\n\n  Line 12656: AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> \"GOC:tfm\"^^xsd:string) Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> \"http://www.immgen.org/index_content.html\"^^xsd:string) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465> \"A conventional dendritic cell that expresses CD11b (ITGAM).\"^^xsd:string)\n\n  Line 12657: AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasOBONamespace> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465> \"cell\"^^xsd:string)\n\n  Line 12658: AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465> \"CD11b-positive dendritic cell\"^^xsd:string)\n\n  Line 12659: AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#creation_date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465> \"2010-11-23T01:50:05Z\"^^xsd:string)\n\n  Line 12660: AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#created_by> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465> \"tmeehan\"^^xsd:string)\n\n  Line 12661: EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465> ObjectIntersectionOf(ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002104> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/PR_000001012>) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000990>))\n\n  Line 12662: SubClassOf(Annotation(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#is_inferred> \"true\"^^xsd:string) <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002465> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0000990>)\n\n  Line 12670: EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/CL_0002466> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://p